Unified Long Video Inpainting and Outpainting
Research modifications by Shuangquan Lyu, Jian Mao, and Yue Ma.
https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.03272

This project includes and modifies code from DiffSynth-Studio:
https://github.com/modelscope/DiffSynth-Studio
Upstream baseline: commit 4f01b37 (the base of the local research branch).
DiffSynth-Studio is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The original LICENSE and source notices have been retained.

Research changes include masked-video LoRA training, video-to-video editing,
overlapping temporal co-denoising, midpoint sampling, and evaluation utilities.
The release cleanup adds command-line interfaces, input validation, temporal
correctness fixes, documentation, and CPU regression checks.

